    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, can u explain what the seller is actually responsible for under CIF Incoterms 2020? need to make sure our contract for this electronics shipment is solid.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Under CIF Incoterms 2020, the seller (reseller) is responsible for delivering the goods to the buyer (reseller) at the named port of shipment. The seller must arrange and pay for the carriage and loading of the goods. Upon handing over the goods, the buyer is responsible for paying the purchase price, unloading the goods, and arranging for onward carriage if required. In essence, the seller handles transportation to the port of shipment and begins insurance coverage, while the buyer assumes responsibility once the goods are on board.",
